{"title":"(Water) Cooler Than You","link":"http://bestof.metafilter.com/2025/01/Water-Cooler-than-You","date":1736155294000,"content":"<p><img src=\"//mefi.us/images/bestof/713A3BC2B2F7FBEA187F6E308E3B1BCE.jpg\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" alt=\"close-up detail of A Complete Unknown film poster showing Timothée Chalamette as Bob Dlan in singlasses against a white background\" /><br /><span>completely unknown? Ways to promote Fanfare on the site ...</span></p><p>In Metatalk, people are talking about <a href=\"https://metatalk.metafilter.com/26540/No-love-for-FanFare\">ideas for promoting and surfacing more Fanfare activity</a>, and in Fanfare itself, <a href=\"https://fanfare.metafilter.com/show/star-wars-skeleton-crew/season/1\">Star Wars: Skeleton Crew</a>, <a href=\"https://fanfare.metafilter.com/25173/Nosferatu\">Nosferatu</a>, <a href=\"https://fanfare.metafilter.com/25212/Yacht-Rock-A-Dockumentary\">Yacht Rock</a>, and <a href=\"https://fanfare.metafilter.com/25176/A-Complete-Unknown\">A Complete Unknown</a> are among current hot topics. See more at <a href=\"https://fanfare.metafilter.com/home/watercooler\">the Watercooler</a>!</p>","author":"taz","siteTitle":"Best of MetaFilter","siteHash":"da9b129197e360b054d48df4b2b523c9cf9eb040c0f8107f5b90f9a1588086c5","entryHash":"ec58e157fe90e594e29d02558541f041bf8c2adb371a3af262e358ff361c7b56","category":"Sites"}